CREATE Procedure [dbo].[QCheckObjectInsured_SysBatchSC](@REGID as varchar(10),@FLDID AS varchar(255),@VALUEID AS varchar(255),@Pdate AS smalldatetime,@PPDate AS smalldatetime)  
as  
SELECT
 A1.BID,
 A1.PolicyNo as [Policy No], 
 A1.Insured, 
 A1.Inception, 
 A1.Expiry, 
 A1.ANO  
from  
 SysBatchSC A1,
 SysBatchH H
Where 
 H.BatchNO = A1.BatchNO
 and H.Status <> 'C'
 and A1.REGID=@REGID and A1.FLDID=@FLDID and A1.ValueID=@VALUEID and A1.FLDID<>''
 and A1.Inception<>A1.Expiry 
 and ((A1.Inception<=@PDATE and A1.Expiry>@PDATE) 
        or 
       (A1.Inception<=@PPDATE and A1.Expiry>@PPDATE) 
        or 
       (@PDATE<=A1.Inception and @PPDATE>A1.Inception))
 AND A1.Status IN ('W')

GO


 
